{
  "schema": "verdant.curriculum.pack.v1",
  "title": "Controls and Boundaries Curriculum 001",
  "description": "A companion to the Vast Developmental Curriculum. It teaches small families that sit on both sides of the structure-eligibility gates, in several shapes, with shared concepts, one-off distractors, blocked and spaced schedules, and affirmed, negated, contested and never-made claims. It never supplies P/Q structures, promotion decisions or expected outcomes.",
